{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose the range of a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/b/ddb04f3a23397fee6e9b1ad8ff840ac76f13e24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[-5,10]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" />. What is the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a205879f624365c1c1773c849be4c20594794f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/9/7396ba97873f330b1ab64efeed108583f3118b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  [-5,10] \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  [-5,5] \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  [5,10] \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  [0,10] \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  (5,\\infty) \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"589\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All of the negative values from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa23984669707ce87c042e3671968fefaad4e31e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[-5, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> will be transformed to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b3573591aba5ba4e9d161e128d858731db316c3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0, 5]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" />. The current range also contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/7/2872eb0dc1de0c6367b541403e6997b3e04d53ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0, 10]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" />, so the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a205879f624365c1c1773c849be4c20594794f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x)|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/4/924522b0a43133310ea51a11a090406efc729be9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } [0, 10]}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"94\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=